To update a voice:

 - ensure that <voice>/voice.sh contains a midi note

   VOICE_MIDI_NOTE=52

 - ensure that <voice>/voice.txt contains labels

 - run

   update-voice.sh <voice> /path/to/new/voice.flac

   this will upload the new flac file with checksum to space.twc.de,
             replace <voice>/voice.flac and compute checksum / upload
             <voice>/voice.sm
             <voice>/voice.volume

